Method toArray returns Arrays.copyOf(queue, size). The comment: "For every valid index i (from 0 to the size of the queue), if the element at index i in the queue is null, then the element at index i in the returned array is also null; otherwise, the element in the queue at index i is equal to the element at index i in the returned array."

